        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "3f8e81f2-9885-5d14-bfb6-5fbc35ec265e",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Imperator, Vaterland, Bismarck, RMS Majestic\n- Topics: Imperator-class ocean liner, largest ship in the world\n\nFacts:\n- The Imperator-class ocean liner included the Imperator, launched in 1912, the Vaterland, launched in 1913, and the Bismarck, launched in 1914.\n- The Bismarck was the largest ship among the Imperator-class liners.\n- RMS Majestic, originally the Bismarck, measured 56,551 gross register tons.\n- RMS Majestic was the largest ship in the world until the completion of a larger ship in 1935.",
